reading: delta is the EXACT change in the token count of the complete message when the span
is absorbed into an appended tape entry. A negative delta is a real saving; the sum of the
negatives would be the arm's value if the moves were independent, which they are not -- each
absorption changes the run structure the next one sees, so the realisable figure is below
the sum. A single fresh glyph P was used for every candidate; the shipped codec could
choose P per candidate, which can only lower the deltas, so this is a conservative reading.
